    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "finding my way back to what tho? everything i worked for is just gone. the injury, the career... it's all dust. i look in the mirror and i don't recognize the person looking back. it's just this empty shell. honestly, it feels like i'm just waiting for the world to realize i'm not part of it anymore.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
