      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's completely understandable to feel lost when major parts of your past identity have been taken away by circumstances like injury or career loss. Right now, perhaps the goal isn't to get back to who you were, but to discover who you are *now*. Focus on small acts of self-compassion and finding tiny pockets of engagement that feel authentic to this present version of you. Healing is a process of building a new self, not just recovering the old one.",
      "source": "target",
