      "content": "When everything feels broken, the weight of building something new can feel exhausting and pointless. Please hold on to the thought that even if the old foundation is gone, you still possess an inherent worth that isn't tied to your past achievements. Instead of \"building,\" perhaps the initial focus could be on allowing yourself to simply *exist* without the pressure of performing or achieving. Sometimes just allowing yourself grace in the present moment is the most radical act of trying.",
